<title>USA: TABLE - Magal Security Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Magal Security Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six Months Ended    Three Months Ended</p>
<p>				     June 30,		 June 30,</p>
<p>				 1997	  1996	1997	1996</p>
<p> Revenues		 $ 12,086    $ 8,369   $ 6,159  $  4,185</p>
<p>Acquisition and</p>
<p>   merger expenses	   997	    -	   -	   -</p>
<p> Net Income(loss)	  (586)	  359	 303	  81</p>
<p>Earnings(loss)</p>
<p>   per Share		(0.09)	 0.07	0.05	0.02</p>
<p>Weighted Average</p>
<p>Number of Shares</p>
<p>Outstanding</p>
<p>				 6,650	4,977     6,650     4,977</p>
<p>	  (U.S. Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Magal Security Systems Ltd said its net loss for the first  six months of 1997 includes $997,000, or $0.14 per share, for all  the current and anticipated near future, merger-related costs that  were expensed as one-time expenses in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The weighted average number of shares outstanding for both the second  quarter and six months of 1997 increased as a result of the sale of  2.1 million shares in a secondary offering that was completed in February  1997.</p>
</text>
